  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这个异次元密阿雷……\n就不能变得再气派些吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E2A5F026B2151435BC6963F96F720262026000A5C314E0D80FD53D85F97518D6C146D3E4E9B5417FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "现在这样怎么看都是商住楼……\n和在现实中的密阿雷没什么两样。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B057288FD96837600E4E48770B90FD662F55464F4F697C20262026000A548C572873B05B9E4E2D76845BC6963F96F76CA14EC04E484E246837300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乌羽！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4C7FBDFF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乌羽！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4C7FBDFF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么啦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E485566FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你给我小费，\n帮我把借款一笔勾销，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我还没好好和你道谢呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F607ED962115C0F8D39FF0C000A5E2E6211628A501F6B3E4E007B1452FE9500FF0C00100001BE00000A62118FD86CA1597D597D548C4F6090538C225462300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你给我小费，\n帮我把借款一笔勾销，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我还没好好和你道谢呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 652,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F607ED962115C0F8D39FF0C000A5E2E6211628A501F6B3E4E007B1452FE9500FF0C00100001BE00000A62118FD86CA1597D597D548C4F6090538C225462300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "借钱还钱，\n就跟借命还命一样！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我只是觉得我们必须保持对等，\n所以才会那么做而已。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "501F94B18FD894B1FF0C000A5C318DDF501F547D8FD8547D4E006837FF0100100001BE01000A621153EA662F89C95F9762114EEC5FC5987B4FDD63015BF97B49FF0C000A62404EE5624D4F1A90A34E48505A800C5DF2300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "话说回来，既然你们都在，\n不如和我们来场对战吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BDD8BF456DE6765FF0C65E271364F604EEC90FD5728FF0C000A4E0D5982548C62114EEC6765573A5BF962185427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然可以！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你也没问题吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53713653EF4EE5FF01000A0010000201000000FF0C4F604E5F6CA195EE98985427FF1F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然可以！\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，你也没问题吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53713653EF4EE5FF01000A0010000201000000FF0C4F604E5F6CA195EE98985427FF1F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "当然可以！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F53713653EF4EE5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么办呢",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E48529E54620000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "别让乌羽久等啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "522B8BA94E4C7FBD4E457B49554A300200100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让乌羽等我们，\n这有点尴尬吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94E4C7FBD7B4962114EECFF0C000A8FD9670970B95C345C2C5427300200100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要队长和王牌齐上阵，\n超Z队就是无敌的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981961F957F548C738B724C9F504E0A9635FF0C000A8D85005A961F5C31662F65E0654C7684FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要队长和王牌齐上阵，\n超Z队就是无敌的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981961F957F548C738B724C9F504E0A9635FF0C000A8D85005A961F5C31662F65E0654C7684FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我希望让蜈蚣王总是为我感到自豪！\n来吧，你会和我对战的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E0C671B8BA9870886A3738B603B662F4E3A6211611F523081EA8C6AFF01000A67655427FF0C4F604F1A548C62115BF9621876845427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想再次在乌羽先生面前\n表现出自己是个可靠的人。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3518D6B2157284E4C7FBD5148751F9762524D000A886873B051FA81EA5DF1662F4E2A53EF976076844EBA300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来对战吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67655BF962185427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "来速战速决吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6765901F6218901F51B35427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次我一定要打哭你！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96B2162114E005B9A8981625354ED4F60FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我心如钢铁，处事不惊。\n无论等多久都没问题。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115FC3598294A294C1FF0C59044E8B4E0D60CA3002000A65E08BBA7B49591A4E4590FD6CA195EE9898300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这事也关乎乌羽先生的面子，\n所以我绝对不会手下留情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94E8B4E5F51734E4E4E4C7FBD5148751F768497625B50FF0C000A62404EE562117EDD5BF94E0D4F1A624B4E0B755960C5300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乌羽他们还在等我们，\n快来打宝可梦对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4C7FBD4ED64EEC8FD857287B4962114EECFF0C000A5FEB676562535B9D53EF68A65BF962185427FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "乌羽他们还在等我们，\n快来打宝可梦对战吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E4C7FBD4ED64EEC8FD857287B4962114EECFF0C000A5FEB676562535B9D53EF68A65BF962185427FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "蜈蚣王！有你并肩作战的话，\n即使是这种局面，我也能笑着渡过！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "870886A3738BFF0167094F605E7680A94F5C621876848BDDFF0C000A53734F7F662F8FD979CD5C409762FF0C62114E5F80FD7B1177406E218FC7FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让你见识一下由超级进化产生的纽带……\n会让盔甲鸟变得多美吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94F6089C18BC64E004E0B75318D857EA78FDB53164EA7751F76847EBD5E2620262026000A4F1A8BA976D475329E1F53D85F97591A7F8E5427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为有你在，\n所以我们也能突破极限！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A67094F605728FF0C000A62404EE562114EEC4E5F80FD7A81783467819650FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因为有你在，\n所以我们也能突破极限！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E04E3A67094F605728FF0C000A62404EE562114EEC4E5F80FD7A81783467819650FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和乌羽他们对战，\n就像浑身被扎了一通……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C4E4C7FBD4ED64EEC5BF96218FF0C000A5C3150CF6D518EAB88AB624E4E864E00901A20262026FF0100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和乌羽他们对战，\n就像浑身被扎了一通……！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C4E4C7FBD4ED64EEC5BF96218FF0C000A5C3150CF6D518EAB88AB624E4E864E00901A20262026FF0100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真不愧是在ZA登峰战最强的2个人。\n看来我们的配合还有不小的差距啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F4E0D6127662F5728005A0041767B5CF0621867005F3A768400324E2A4EBA3002000A770B676562114EEC7684914D54088FD867094E0D5C0F76845DEE8DDD554A300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都是因为我实力不足\n才导致这样的结果……十分抱歉。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD662F56E04E3A62115B9E529B4E0D8DB3000A624D5BFC81F48FD9683776847ED3679C202620265341520662B16B49300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你表现得很好。\n我一直都很感谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60886873B05F975F88597D3002000A62114E0076F490FD5F88611F8C224F60300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们在现实中的密阿雷也常见面，\n还是快散场吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC572873B05B9E4E2D76845BC6963F96F74E5F5E3889C19762FF0C000A8FD8662F5FEB6563573A5427300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这衣服给你了！\n不过我有件事要拜托你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD98863670D7ED94F604E86FF01000A4E0D8FC7621167094EF64E8B898162DC62584F60300200100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>获得了\n乌羽装扮西服套装！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000083B75F974E86000A4E4C7FBD88C5626E897F670D595788C5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "超Z队和我们之间\n有点不明不白的对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8D85005A961F548C62114EEC4E4B95F4000A670970B94E0D660E4E0D767D76845BF95427FF1F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "锈蚀组会让从河里跳出来的\n鲤鱼王沉到河底，<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n或是把正要脱皮的阿柏蛇的皮剥掉，\n是个特别狠毒的团体！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "950886807EC44F1A8BA94ECE6CB391CC8DF351FA67657684000A9CA49C7C738B6C8952306CB35E95FF0C00100001BE01000A6216662F628A6B638981813176AE7684963F67CF86C7768476AE52656389FF0C000A662F4E2A7279522B72E06BD2768456E24F53FF0100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们也是要面子的，\n你们可要小心点。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
